    content:
      'Professors Jeffs and Warnick along with a few ECEn students installed a super-sensitive antenna for processing signals from deep space at about the same spot where Pierce Brosnan and Sean Bean battled it out in the James Bond film GoldenEye.\n\nSee the location in this video. (opens in a new tab)',
