    title: "Dr.'s Jensen and Rice land DOD Grant to Advance Flight Testing",
    description:
      'Dr. Jensen and Dr. Rice were awarded nearly $1 million in grant money to improve air-to-ground communications during Air Force flight tests.',
    date: '2018-05-03',
