    content:
      'Come and join us for a ECE on diplay. It will be held on April 1, 2010 1:00 -5:00 p.m. in the Wilkinson Center Garden Court. Come look at this challenging, rewarding, and in-demand field!\n\nEvery electronic device made is designed and developed by electrical and computer engineers. Cordless phones, cell phones, video phones, high-definition TV, personal computers, iPhones, Blackberries, magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) systems, automobile control systems, robotics, Bluetooth, and DVD players are only a few of the systems for which electrical and computer engineers are responsible.',
